# A module may use what its own file declares outside it (spec/lib/pantry.kex:
# `shelves` and the `Jar` constructors), on both backends, though a program
# that brings the module in cannot name them
# (spec/error_dependency_top_level.kex).

using Pantry

main do
  IO.printLine(stocked())
  IO.printLine(Pantry.first)
end
